      "name": "主题导航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-active",
      "description": "四主题导航的当前页与可见交互状态。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"主题\"><a href=\"#economic\" aria-current=\"page\">季度经济</a><a href=\"#tourism\">旅游与住宿</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:5px;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Noto Sans SC\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;}.ds-nav a{padding:8px 15px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted,#52717f)}.ds-nav a:hover{background:#f1f6f8}.ds-nav a[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:var(--accent-soft,#e5f4f5);color:var(--accent,#087b85);font-weight:700}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#087b85);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "发布年份标记",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "vintage-tag",
      "description": "实际发布年份，不是可点击筛选标签。",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-vintage\">2024年</span>",
      "css": ".ds-vintage{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;color:var(--accent,#087b85);background:var(--accent-soft,#e5f4f5);padding:2px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Noto Sans SC\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "图表面板",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "白色图面、标题、单位与放大操作。",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-panel\"><header><div><h3>观察期结构</h3><p>单位：万人</p></div><button aria-label=\"放大图表\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 4H4v4m12-4h4v4M4 16v4h4m12-4v4h-4\"/></svg></button></header><div class=\"ds-chart-space\">图表区域</div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line,#dbe7ed);border-radius:15px;overflow:hidden;color:var(--ink,#173844);font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Noto Sans SC\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;}.ds-panel header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;padding:17px 17px 3px;gap:7px}.ds-panel h3{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0}.ds-panel p{font-size:11px;color:var(--subtle,#506c78);margin:3px 0 0}.ds-panel button{background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:4px;padding:3px;color:var(--subtle,#506c78);cursor:pointer}.ds-panel button:hover{background:var(--accent-soft,#e5f4f5);color:var(--accent,#087b85)}.ds-panel button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#087b85);outline-offset:3px}.ds-panel svg{width:15px;height:15px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6}.ds-chart-space{height:120px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--muted,#52717f);font-size:12px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "关键指标",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "kpi",
      "description": "大数字与紧随数值的单位。",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-kpi\"><div class=\"ds-label\">观察指标</div><div class=\"ds-value\">1,234.5<span>万人</span></div><div class=\"ds-change\">同比 <b>+1.6%</b></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-kpi{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 5px 16px rgba(24,63,78,.055);padding:17px 18px 13px;color:var(--ink,#173844);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Noto Sans SC\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;}.ds-label{font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--muted,#52717f)}.ds-value{font-size:31px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-value span{font-size:12px;margin-left:4px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--muted,#52717f)}.ds-change{font-size:11px;color:var(--subtle,#506c78)}.ds-change b{color:var(--positive,#0a7e83)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "口径分段控件",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "segmented-active",
      "description": "经济主题的当季与累计状态。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-segment\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"统计口径\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\">当季</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\">累计</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-segment{display:inline-flex;background:#e8f0f3;padding:3px;border-radius:9px;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Noto Sans SC\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;}.ds-segment button{border:0;border-radius:7px;color:var(--muted,#52717f);background:transparent;padding:6px 11px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}.ds-segment button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:#fff;color:var(--accent,#087b85);box-shadow:0 1px 5px #17384410;font-weight:700}.ds-segment button:hover{color:var(--accent,#087b85)}.ds-segment button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#087b85);outline-offset:3px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "清晰可核查的统计驾驶舱",
    "overview": "以用户固定的季度经济、教育与旅游看板参考为视觉依据，使用雾蓝底色、白色图面、深色中文和克制的分类色，让时间、规模、结构与变化可以在同一屏中比较。界面由工具栏、指标与图组构成，视觉重点始终落在数据。\n\n经济和旅游采用青蓝主色，教育与人口采用各自的蓝紫主题色；共同的留白、层级和组件使四个主题保持一致。这里记录的是完成后的原生 HTML/CSS/ECharts 实现，代码与实际输出优先于早期意图；方向标识为 pinned-reference-20261119。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "浅雾蓝画布与白色图面，紧凑而有层级。",
      "中文无衬线字体、等宽数字与清晰单位。",
      "同一分类跨图保持颜色一致。",
      "桌面多列图组，手机按阅读顺序纵向展开。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Theme Continuity Rule",
        "body": "经济和旅游使用青蓝主题，教育和人口保留已实现的蓝紫主题；所有主题共享同一套中性色与组件结构。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Category Identity Rule",
        "body": "分类颜色代表稳定的数据类别；教育的平行坐标、面积图和图例沿用同一学段映射。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Measured Label Rule",
        "body": "图表保留单位，明细与导出使用完整指标名称及口径；缩写只用于需要节省空间的图内标签。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Depth Rule",
        "body": "常态图面以白色、浅边框和间距分组；显著阴影留给模态层，指标仅用轻微环境阴影。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 保留雾蓝背景、白色面板及各主题现有主色。",
      "Do 使用统一时间轴联动图表、指标和明细，并保留实际发布年份标记。",
      "Do 在图表说明或坐标轴上持续显示单位；保留完整指标名称与统计口径。",
      "Do 保持分类图例、数据标记和跨图类别颜色一致。",
      "Do 在手机上采用单列图表与两列指标，并保留可操作的筛选工具。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 添加栅格主视觉或装饰性照片抢占统计图表空间。",
      "Don't 把教育和人口的蓝紫主题强行改成通用青蓝。",
      "Don't 用浅色文字覆盖矩形树图或热力图的数据块；沿用深色标签。",
      "Don't 通过补造缺失年份、隐藏口径差异或只给缩写来制造完整感。"
    ]
  }
}
